# Direct runtime dependencies of the Trader image (ADR-050, ADR-053). The lock file is compiled from this.
#
# Only what `src/aidss_trader`, `alembic_trader` and the image's database driver import. The analysis
# platform's `[project].dependencies` in pyproject.toml carry more (pandas, numpy, curl_cffi, bcrypt,
# PyJWT, croniter, pgvector, email-validator) that the Trader never imports, so they are not installed here.
# `uvicorn` is the plain package: the Trader serves no WebSocket, and its settings read the environment
# only (`env_file=None`), so the `[standard]` extras (uvloop, httptools, websockets, watchfiles,
# python-dotenv, PyYAML) would be dead weight.
#
# Lower bounds mirror pyproject.toml so the two cannot drift apart unnoticed (see tests/trader/test_security_s1_s17.py).
